T* (conducts a structured walkthrough of the home's key areas — stairs and circulation, bathrooms, exterior entry, bedrooms and living areas,) Tj
T* (life-safety systems, and kitchen and laundry — to identify fall risks, hazards, and safety concerns. The specialist documents each finding with) Tj
T* (photos, notes recommended corrections, generates a standardized residential safety report, and delivers it to the Client's designated family) Tj
T* (dashboard the same day. This plan may include the complimentary minor safety courtesies described in Section 7 \(such as replacing a bulb,) Tj
T* (placing a plug-in nightlight, or securing a loose cord\). It does not include the proactive hazard-clearing, item relocation, or expanded mitigation) Tj
T* (services offered under Plan 2, and does not include any general or routine housekeeping, laundry, meal preparation, or personal care of any kind.) Tj
